From c8dd4156c3eb743fcefacb8f602df8b847c4f97a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Date: Wed, 31 Jan 2024 15:42:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 714/913] dts: stm32mp15: add low power modes and regulator
 levels

Add to the boards the pwr node to define the supported low
power mode and the specific low power states of all
board regulators.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 3d4cfaa377ee7f8ec9196104a39e3c01360866a5 dts: stm32mp15: add low power modes and regulator levels]
Change-Id: I71687404231680e93ae00b0b6b6ab39ab9a4ce3d
Signed-off-by: Lionel Debieve <lionel.debieve@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/358379
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
